{"4581890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kayak with friends", "steam_appid": 4581890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends, on kayaks! Master the art of kayaking and conquer fierce rivers with your friends (and against them). Explore the world’s most beautiful rivers and become the ultimate kayak champion in this frantic racing adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/c7ac3f9a2e7816e1d4a243111089a08f.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/c7ac3f9a2e7816e1d4a243111089a08f.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/c7ac3f9a2e7816e1d4a243111089a08f.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLLER RECOMMENDED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KWF is fully playable with mouse and keyboard, but it was designed as a controller-based experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPETITIVE KAYAK RACING FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, your kayak, and some friends! Explore and conquer beautiful rivers of the world. Race your friends in a series of challenging rivers where you must learn and master the ways of the Kayak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/090c050341bd6c56653ce3c5555deb8b.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/090c050341bd6c56653ce3c5555deb8b.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/090c050341bd6c56653ce3c5555deb8b.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARTY ROCKING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river calls for respect and awe, but we’re here for the fun! Use rhythmic mechanics synchronized with the music and get an edge over the rest. Get points with your technique and skills, conquer the challenges and become the best kayaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/0fd1e52eecfbc0bc248b18f16580f32d.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/0fd1e52eecfbc0bc248b18f16580f32d.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/0fd1e52eecfbc0bc248b18f16580f32d.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAPHICS AND PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kayak your way through dangerous waters. The advanced dynamic water system simulates fluid mechanics that are very similar to the real thing. Use the water physics to your benefit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/8df96a99930b01ca348ee83cdc70e2e4.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/8df96a99930b01ca348ee83cdc70e2e4.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/8df96a99930b01ca348ee83cdc70e2e4.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE CHALLENGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn kayak points throughout the races and challenges. Upgrade your gear and look to become the ultimate kayak master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/983d5fb9866dc02f963f5f52ad93e9bd.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/983d5fb9866dc02f963f5f52ad93e9bd.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/983d5fb9866dc02f963f5f52ad93e9bd.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINIGAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like land-based sports but can’t stand being away from your kayak? We neither. Play soccer, tag, and other minigames on water. Of course, with friends.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends, on kayaks! Master the art of kayaking and conquer fierce rivers with your friends (and against them). Explore the world’s most beautiful rivers and become the ultimate kayak champion in this frantic racing adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/c7ac3f9a2e7816e1d4a243111089a08f.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/c7ac3f9a2e7816e1d4a243111089a08f.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/c7ac3f9a2e7816e1d4a243111089a08f.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLLER RECOMMENDED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KWF is fully playable with mouse and keyboard, but it was designed as a controller-based experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPETITIVE KAYAK RACING FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, your kayak, and some friends! Explore and conquer beautiful rivers of the world. Race your friends in a series of challenging rivers where you must learn and master the ways of the Kayak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/090c050341bd6c56653ce3c5555deb8b.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/090c050341bd6c56653ce3c5555deb8b.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/090c050341bd6c56653ce3c5555deb8b.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARTY ROCKING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river calls for respect and awe, but we’re here for the fun! Use rhythmic mechanics synchronized with the music and get an edge over the rest. Get points with your technique and skills, conquer the challenges and become the best kayaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/0fd1e52eecfbc0bc248b18f16580f32d.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/0fd1e52eecfbc0bc248b18f16580f32d.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/0fd1e52eecfbc0bc248b18f16580f32d.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAPHICS AND PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kayak your way through dangerous waters. The advanced dynamic water system simulates fluid mechanics that are very similar to the real thing. Use the water physics to your benefit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/8df96a99930b01ca348ee83cdc70e2e4.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/8df96a99930b01ca348ee83cdc70e2e4.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/8df96a99930b01ca348ee83cdc70e2e4.mp4?t=1787702505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE CHALLENGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn kayak points throughout the races and challenges. Upgrade your gear and look to become the ultimate kayak master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/983d5fb9866dc02f963f5f52ad93e9bd.poster.avif?t=1787702505\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4581890/extras/983d5fb9866dc02f963f5f52ad93e9bd.webm?t=1787702505\" type=\"vid